{
  "apiVersion": "dashboard.grafana.app/v2",
  "kind": "Dashboard",
  "metadata": {
    "name": "paris-bike-counters"
  },
  "spec": {
    "annotations": [
      {
        "kind": "AnnotationQuery",
        "spec": {
          "builtIn": true,
          "enable": true,
          "hide": true,
          "iconColor": "rgba(0, 211, 255, 1)",
          "name": "Annotations \u0026 Alerts",
          "query": {
            "datasource": {
              "name": "-- Grafana --"
            },
            "group": "grafana",
            "kind": "DataQuery",
            "spec": {},
            "version": "v0"
          }
        }
      }
    ],
    "cursorSync": "Off",
    "description": "Paris’s 108 bike counters over the last 28 days, hour by hour: every counter in one heatmap, grouped by arrondissement, with a soft maximum that moves the colour from each counter’s own scale to one shared by all; a timeline with play, a map of the counters, bikes by arrondissement and the average day, all filtering each other in the browser.",
    "editable": true,
    "elements": {
      "panel-about": {
        "kind": "Panel",
        "spec": {
          "data": {
            "kind": "QueryGroup",
            "spec": {
              "queries": [],
              "queryOptions": {},
              "transformations": []
            }
          },
          "description": "",
          "id": 10,
          "links": [],
          "title": "About the data",
          "vizConfig": {
            "group": "text",
            "kind": "VizConfig",
            "spec": {
              "fieldConfig": {
                "defaults": {},
                "overrides": []
              },
              "options": {
                "code": {
                  "language": "plaintext",
                  "showLineNumbers": false,
                  "showMiniMap": false
                },
                "content": "### Where the data comes from\n\n- **Bike counts**: [Comptage vélo — données compteurs](https://opendata.paris.fr/explore/dataset/comptage-velo-donnees-compteurs/) on Paris Data, the City of Paris’s open data portal (Licence ODbL). The counters are Eco-Counter loops in the cycle lanes; each direction of travel is a counter of its own. The City publishes the hourly counts once a day, up to the evening before, and keeps the last 13 months.\n- **Arrondissements**: [Arrondissements](https://opendata.paris.fr/explore/dataset/arrondissements/) on Paris Data. Two counters on the quai d’Issy are just outside the city, in Issy-les-Moulineaux: they are *Outside Paris*.\n\n### How it is computed\n\n- **The last 28 days**, hour by hour, on the **Paris clock** (the time a rush hour keeps all year). On the night the clocks go back, the two 2 a.m. hours are added together.\n- **Each counter’s busiest hour** of the 28 days is its peak. The heatmap colours each hour over the larger of that peak and the **soft max** of the slider: at 0 every counter is on its own scale, so a quiet street’s rush hour reads like the boulevard de Sébastopol’s; raised, the quiet counters stay pale; past the busiest hour of all, every counter is on one scale. The map colours each hour over the counter’s own peak.\n- **Missing is not zero**: an hour the City did not publish is an empty cell; an hour with no bike is the darkest colour. Whole days are sometimes missing for every counter.\n- **Rows** are grouped by arrondissement, busiest counter first, with an empty row between two arrondissements.\n\n### How it works\n\nThe server reads the counts from Paris Data (one request, about 70,000 hours) and places each counter in its arrondissement with DuckDB’s spatial extension; it hands them to your browser (Chaski). The filters, play, the map, the heatmap and the charts (Mosaic) are answered there, without going back to the server. **Reload the page** to bring in a new day.\n\nThe heatmap borrows from the [Mosaic Plot](https://github.com/boazreicher/mosaic-plot) panel (no relation to UW’s Mosaic): many series in little space, grouped with gaps, and a soft maximum for the colour.",
                "mode": "markdown"
              }
            },
            "version": "13.2.1"
          }
        }
      },
      "panel-arr": {
        "kind": "Panel",
        "spec": {
          "data": {
            "kind": "QueryGroup",
            "spec": {
              "queries": [],
              "queryOptions": {},
              "transformations": []
            }
          },
          "description": "Bikes counted in each arrondissement, in the window and area the filters leave. The 6th and the 9th have no counter. Click a bar to keep an arrondissement, Shift+click to add another.",
          "id": 8,
          "links": [],
          "title": "Bikes by arrondissement",
          "vizConfig": {
            "group": "ubica-chaski-mosaic-panel",
            "kind": "VizConfig",
            "spec": {
              "fieldConfig": {
                "defaults": {},
                "overrides": []
              },
              "options": {
                "preaggregate": true,
                "reads": "",
                "spec": "params:\n  bikeFilters: { select: crossfilter }\nplot:\n  - mark: barX\n    data: { from: bikes, filterBy: $bikeFilters }\n    x: { sum: bikes }\n    y: arrondissement\n    fill: '#5794F2'\n  - select: toggleY\n    as: $bikeFilters\nyDomain: ['1er', '2e', '3e', '4e', '5e', '6e', '7e', '8e', '9e', '10e', '11e', '12e', '13e', '14e', '15e', '16e', '17e', '18e', '19e', '20e', 'Outside Paris']\nxLabel: Bikes →\nyLabel: null\nxTickFormat: s\nmarginLeft: 84\n",
                "variables": ""
              }
            }
          }
        }
      },
      "panel-busiest": {
        "kind": "Panel",
        "spec": {
          "data": {
            "kind": "QueryGroup",
            "spec": {
              "queries": [],
              "queryOptions": {},
              "transformations": []
            }
          },
          "description": "The most bikes one counter saw in one hour, among those the filters leave.",
          "id": 2,
          "links": [],
          "title": "Busiest hour",
          "vizConfig": {
            "group": "ubica-chaski-mosaic-panel",
            "kind": "VizConfig",
            "spec": {
              "fieldConfig": {
                "defaults": {},
                "overrides": []
              },
              "options": {
                "preaggregate": true,
                "reads": "",
                "spec": "params:\n  bikeFilters: { select: crossfilter }\nplot:\n  - mark: text\n    data: { from: bikes, filterBy: $bikeFilters }\n    text: { sql: \"coalesce(format('{:,} bikes', max(bikes)::BIGINT), '–')\" }\n    frameAnchor: middle\n    dy: -9\n    fill: '#FDE725'\n    fontSize: 30\n    fontWeight: 500\n  - mark: text\n    data: { from: bikes, filterBy: $bikeFilters }\n    text: { sql: \"coalesce(regexp_replace(arg_max(name, bikes), '^(Totem|Face au) ', '') || ' · ' || strftime(arg_max(time, bikes), '%a %d %H:00'), '')\" }\n    frameAnchor: middle\n    dy: 16\n    fill: currentColor\n    fontSize: 11\nxAxis: null\nyAxis: null\nmargin: 0\ncolorScale: identity\n",
                "variables": ""
              }
            }
          }
        }
      },
